// ============================================================================
// Niri configuration adapted from the Hyprland configuration in this project.
//
// Niri uses KDL and is a scrollable-tiling compositor, so some Hyprland
// concepts have been translated instead of copied literally.
//
// Main configuration:
//   ~/.config/niri/config.kdl
//
// Niri supports top-level include files and live-reloads them.
// Validate with: niri validate
// ============================================================================

